"If the daemon log on the Advanced tab says “Permission denied”, your account can't open the box's port yet: restart the computer once, then replug the box." = "如果「高级」页的 daemon 日志里有 “Permission denied”，说明你的账户还打不开盒子的串口：重启一次电脑，再重新插上盒子。";
"Still nothing? Hold K0 on the box while you plug in the cable. The box starts in download mode with a dark screen, ready to be flashed with Vibe Buddy firmware." = "还是不行？按住盒子的 K0 再插线。盒子会以下载模式启动，屏幕不亮，接着刷入 Vibe Buddy 固件即可。";
"No box yet — this updates once you plug it in." = "还没找到盒子，插上后这里会变。";
"Starting the daemon…" = "daemon 正在启动…";
"Connect your agents so their progress shows up on the box." = "接入 Agent：让它们的进展传到盒子上。";
"Only session IDs, event names and working directories are forwarded. After writing Codex's config, trust it once on its /hooks page." = "只转发会话标识、事件名和工作目录。Codex 写入后要在它的 /hooks 页面信任一次。";
"Pick an announcement voice." = "挑一个播报音色。";
"The box's built-in voice speaks English (Jessica); pick a Chinese voice above to hear announcements in Chinese." = "盒子内置的是英文音色（Jessica）；想听中文播报，在上面挑一个中文音色。";
"If you skip this, the box uses its built-in voice, Jessica (English)." = "不选就用盒子内置的英文音色 Jessica。";
"Start Vibe Buddy automatically when you log in?" = "登录时自动启动 Vibe Buddy？";
"macOS may say a background item was added — that's expected." = "系统可能会提示「已添加后台项目」，那是 macOS 的正常提示。";
"All set." = "好了。";
"Vibe Buddy lives in the menu bar: the icon is the buddy's face, with its eyes open while the box is online. To change anything, choose Settings… from its menu, or open Vibe Buddy again." = "Vibe Buddy 住在菜单栏里：图标是氛围小助手的脸，盒子在线时睁着眼。想改什么，点菜单里的「设置…」，或者再打开一次 Vibe Buddy。";

